{"characterId":"char_c47673","characterName":"上位種族の男","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"51136","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"178431"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8635"],"vndbCharacterId":"c47673"},"originalCharacterName":"上位種族の男","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An organism comes from different world. His appearance is really similar to human beings, but his abilities are beyond humans."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He eats (kills) every single organism in the world, which is his purpose of coming to human world."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c47673"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"別の世界からやって来た生物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外見は人間と酷似しているが、人間にはない能力を多く持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"上位種族は世界の生物を食い尽くし（殺し尽くし）、次の世界へ飛ぶ、という生活を繰り返しており、人間の世界にも同様の目的でやって来た。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8635","sourceWorkId":"23562","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"凌辱殘虐美亞的罪魁禍首，屬於來自其他世界的上位種族，"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"上位種族是一種會將一個星球吃光殺光後，"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"再去下一個星球繼續殺的種族，而這也是他們的生存意義。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"51136"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/72/728140c47d8a139cdac9d954707c0e7b55d67001c0d3654010b9f8ea47fa6867.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/eb/eb0ee13cbe6e2ab60867c0c34ace3cd5ed48a416ffb9c5366ab3e3a851f6811b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c134432","characterName":"ウルティナ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c134432"},"originalCharacterName":"ウルティナ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","me